473024.0,"debt_to_equity":57.801,"enterprise_value":2649256960.0,"enterprise_to_ebitda":4.863,"enterprise_to_revenue":0.288,"earnings_growth":0.047,"shares_outstanding":12927780.0,"float_shares":5931870.0,"held_pct_insiders":0.53704,"held_pct_institutions":0.0,"beta":0.1,"fifty_two_week_high":222.0,"fifty_two_week_low":136.23,"fifty_day_average":164.4018,"two_hundred_day_avg":180.8057,"recommendation":"none","all_time_high":278.0,"all_time_low":10.5,"long_business_summary":"Cords Cable Industries Limited engages in the design, development, manufacture, and sale of power, control, instrumentation, thermocouple extension/compensating, and communication cables in India. It offers cables, such as fieldbus, fire survival, EPR, low temperature, fire retardant low smoke, low smoke zero halogen, oil and gas, water desalination and special custom-designed hybrid, and PV solar cables. The company's control cables are used in the interconnection of process control, communication, panel control systems, and mining areas; electrical cables are used for electric power, lighting, and internal wiring; and power cables are used in connecting power supply to residential, commercial, and industrial units, as well as infrastructure projects. Its instrumentation, signal, and data cables are applied in data acquisition systems, computer networking, PA systems, digital control/measuring, and communication and fire alarm systems; and thermocouple cables are used to extend thermocouple circuits from the sensor to reference units. The company also exports its products. It serves power generation, electricity transmission and distribution, oil refining and distribution, petrochemicals, iron and steel, chemicals and fertilizers, cement, and engineering industries. Cords Cable Industries Limited was founded in 1987 and is headquartered in New Delhi, India."}}